   "sample_values": [
    "Ah! A new face in this territory! My, it isn't often we see people walk this road alone, what with all the bandits infesting it...",
    "Ahem!",
    "And Shinmen suspects they're plotting against the shogun.",
    "Apologies about the welcome, my friend. I\u2019m glad to see you weren\u2019t injured.",
    "Attagirl, Kinme! Your eyes are as sharp as ever! I knew we'd find our friend if we  looked hard enough.",
